vileged user appsvc on node1, published on port 8080, managed by a Podman Quadlet systemd --user unit (webapp.service) wired into default.target. Enabled loginctl linger for appsvc so the user's systemd instance and container start at boot without any active login session. Verified with a full node reboot: boot ID changed, no login sessions existed post-boot, yet the container auto-started and served HTTP 200 on port 8080.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Installed podman, uidmap, slirp4netns, fuse-overlayfs, dbus-user-session on node1\",\"Created unprivileged user appsvc with auto-assigned subuid/subgid ranges\",\"Enabled loginctl linger for appsvc (State=lingering)\",\"Pulled docker.io/library/nginx:alpine as appsvc via rootless podman\",\"Verified initial rootless container run on port 8080 (HTTP 200)\",\"Created ~/.config/containers/systemd/webapp.container Quadlet unit (PublishPort=8080:80, Restart=always) for appsvc, generating webapp.service pulled in by default.target\",\"Started webapp.service and confirmed it is a dependency of default.target for auto-start at boot\",\"Captured pre-restart baseline: boot_id, running container, linger state\",\"Issued shutdown -r now in background on node1; acknowledgement returned before disconnect\",\"Polled node1 until exec was available again\",\"Verified changed boot_id proving genuine restart\",\"Verified post-restart: no login sessions exist, appsvc linger still active, user@1000.service running, webapp container up and serving HTTP 200 on port 8080\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Container app runs as unprivileged appsvc user via rootless podman\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-bb6b8054ef094495\",\"cmd-961168936644430b\"],\"summary\":\"appsvc created as uid 1000 with subuid/subgid ranges; podman info confirms Rootless=true when run as appsvc\"},{\"requirement\":\"App serves on port 8080\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9fb14985a8be4dd0\",\"cmd-0a11c2bf9b8f4f14\"],\"summary\":\"curl to $NODE_IP:8080 returned HTTP 200 both before and after Quadlet unit setup\"},{\"requirement\":\"Service starts at boot while appsvc has no active login session (pre-restart setup)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a9a5e834ec474ab2\",\"cmd-088e040d468f4fe1\",\"cmd-0593bf74fcfa49d1\",\"cmd-ec66366f815f4e5b\",\"cmd-0a11c2bf9b8f4f14\"],\"summary\":\"loginctl enable-linger set for appsvc; user@1000.service running via linger without login; webapp.container Quadlet generated webapp.service, started successfully, and confirmed as a dependency of default.target\"},{\"requirement\":\"Pre-restart healthy baseline (node1)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-2916984835eb4fd6\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 8d1d94e2-39c3-492e-b9eb-974d111d2137, running webapp container on 8080, and Linger=yes prior to restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node1 restart acknowledgement returns before disconnect\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-167d55266700480a\"],\"summary\":\"shutdown -r now issued in background; 'reboot-initiated' returned immediately, followed by a connection timeout on the next call confirming the node went down\"},{\"requirement\":\"Node1 boot identity changed (proof of actual restart)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-0a7123508ae8410c\",\"cmd-cc934ba69dd743a1\",\"cmd-1d2f6595514c4db7\"],\"summary\":\"Post-restart boot_id is bcecbd1c-533e-4727-bda9-6d47c61b9dd8, differing from the pre-restart boot_id, with uptime -s showing a new boot time; connectivity confirmed restored after the outage window\"},{\"requirement\":\"Post-restart recovery: service starts at boot with no active login session, and app is healthy\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-7f60a36e1ee641fe\"],\"summary\":\"After reboot: 'No sessions.' from loginctl (no login for appsvc), Linger=yes still set, user@1000.service active since the new boot, webapp container up and serving HTTP 200 on port 8080 — all without any interactive login\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Deployed a rootless Podman container (nginx:alpine) as unprivileged user appsvc on node1, published on port 8080, managed b